# 안내서 3.58: 기억의 문을 걸어 들어가는 방식으로 (이야기 장소로 가는 법 · 기억의 문 쪽의 고친 글)
START = 759
EN = [
"Story places come in three kinds. Each one opens only while you are on the quest that sends you there.\n\n· Traces: things to look at. A pillar of light and a ring on the ground that only you can see. (See 'Looking at traces'.)\n· The Memory Gate: the room where you fight a story boss. Open the gate with the quest's button, then walk into it. (See 'The Memory Gate'.)\n· Far-off structures: hold the Survey Compass and right-click for the direction and distance. It only points to places that really exist, more than 1000 blocks from town.\n\nThe '➤ about N blocks to the …' line on the quest display is where the person or trace you should go to now is.\n\nA boss the story has not reached yet is behind a ward. If you are pushed back, do the quests before it first.",
"Story bosses do not stand somewhere in the world. You fight them in a room set apart, beyond the Memory Gate.\n\n· You must be on the quest that asks you to defeat that boss.\n· Opening it: in the quest journal (/rtshop quest) or in an NPC's quest talk, pick that quest and press the 'Memory Gate · Boss fight' button. A gate opens three or four blocks ahead of you (a ring of ash on the ground and a doorframe of firelight).\n· Going in: walk into the gate. Party members within 16 blocks of the one who opened it cross over together. After that, until the boss wakes, party members can still walk into the gate to join.\n· The gate closes after a minute if nobody goes in. Press the button to open it again.\n· Inside, the boss is still asleep. When you are ready, right-click the ember in the middle. If nobody touches it, the boss wakes by itself after a while (the time left is shown at the bottom of the screen).\n· When it falls, its drops go to your bag and you return to where the gate stood.\n· You do not lose Gold if you fall inside. Open the gate again to retry.\n· Return tickets cannot be used inside.\n\nSome opponents are met without the Memory Gate. For those, go to the structure the quest names.",
]
